
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#111111">
  <meta name="description" content="Confira seu pedido na SóAchei.">
  <title>Meu carrinho — SóAchei</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="Style.css">

  <style>
    .cart-page {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 35px auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .cart-page h1 {
      margin: 20px 0 10px;
    }

    .cart-back {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .cart-panel {
      background: white;
      color: #111;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      margin-top: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    }

    .cart-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 15px;
      padding: 18px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    }

    .cart-emoji {
      font-size: 35px;
    }

    .cart-product {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 130px;
    }

    .cart-product p {
      color: #777;
      margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .quantity {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .quantity button,
    .remove-item {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .quantity button {
      background: #eee;
      color: #111;
    }

    .remove-item {
      background: #fff0f0;
      color: #b00020;
    }

    .cart-summary {
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 2px solid #eee;
    }

    .cart-summary h2 {
      margin: 12px 0;
    }

    .cart-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .cart-actions a,
    .cart-actions button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .back-products {
      background: #eee;
      color: #111;
    }

    .finish-order {
      background: #ffd400;
      color: #111;
    }

    .empty-cart {
      padding: 35px 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .empty-cart .empty-icon {
      font-size: 55px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .empty-cart p {
      margin: 12px 0 20px;
      color: #777;
    }

    .cart-count-label {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #fff5bd;
      color: #111;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .cart-page {
        padding: 15px;
      }

      .cart-panel {
        padding: 16px;
      }

      .cart-row {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .cart-product {
        min-width: 60%;
      }

      .quantity {
        margin-left: 45px;
      }

      .remove-item {
        margin-left: auto;
      }

      .cart-actions a,
      .cart-actions button {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="top">
    <div class="header-main">
      <a class="logo" href="index.html">
        <span class="bag">🛍️</span>
        <span>
          Só<span>Achei</span>
          <small>Achou. Gostou. Comprou.</small>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="cart-page">
    <a class="cart-back" href="index.html">← Continuar comprando</a>

    <h1>🛒 Meu carrinho</h1>
    <p>Confira seus produtos antes de finalizar o pedido.</p>
    <span class="cart-count-label" id="cartCountLabel">
      0 produtos no carrinho
    </span>

    <section class="cart-panel">
      <div id="cartItems">
        <p>Carregando carrinho...</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cart-summary">
        <p>Subtotal: <strong id="cartSubtotal">R$ 0,00</strong></p>
        <h2>Total: <span id="cartTotal">R$ 0,00</span></h2>
        <p style="color:#777;font-size:13px">
          Frete e prazo serão confirmados no atendimento.
        </p>

        <div class="cart-actions">
          <a class="back-products" href="index.html">
            Continuar comprando
          </a>

          <button
            type="button"
            class="finish-order"
            onclick="checkout()"
          >
            Finalizar pelo WhatsApp
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"
       style="display:none;margin-top:15px"></p>
  </main>

  <footer class="container footer">
    <a href="index.html" class="logo">🛍️ SóAchei</a>
    <p>Achou. Gostou. Comprou.</p>
    <p>© <span id="year">2026</span> SóAchei. Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("year").textContent =
      new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>

  <script src="Script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
